# CODEOWNERS — human review gates (the REAL enforcement for CP-1 / ADR-0009).
#
# ACTION REQUIRED: replace @owner with the real human GitHub handle/team, then
# enable branch protection on the default branch with "Require review from Code
# Owners". A local script (approve_master_context.py) cannot gate the agent that
# runs it; only forge-side required review can. See docs/architecture/ADR-0009.

# --- Highest sensitivity: human-gated master context + its lock (CP-1) ---
/.ai/control/MASTER_CONTEXT.md        @owner
/.ai/control/MASTER_CONTEXT.lock.yaml @owner

# --- Governance + control plane ---
/.github/                @owner
/AI_FRONT_DOOR.md         @owner
/ROADMAP.md               @owner
/ROADMAP_STATE.yaml       @owner
/HANDOFF_PROTOCOL.md      @owner
/LICENSE                  @owner
/docs/architecture/       @owner
/docs/chunking/           @owner
/config/chunking/         @owner
/config/canon/            @owner
/config/governance/       @owner
/schemas/                 @owner

# --- Immutable raw sources ---
/data/raw/                @owner
